{"case_id": "HT01", "text": "预售等太久了，我退掉，货没发。", "intent": "refund", "aftersales_type": "refund_only", "hard": true, "note": "未发货退款"}
{"case_id": "HT02", "text": "下错单了，麻烦把钱退回来，仓库还没发。", "intent": "refund", "aftersales_type": "refund_only", "hard": false, "note": "未发货退款"}
{"case_id": "HT03", "text": "赠品缺了两个，折 30 块退我。", "intent": "refund", "aftersales_type": "refund_only", "hard": true, "note": "赠品缺件补退"}
{"case_id": "HT04", "text": "结算时多算运费，退我 12 块。", "intent": "refund", "aftersales_type": "refund_only", "hard": false, "note": "运费差额"}
{"case_id": "HT05", "text": "我重复付了一次款，退一笔。", "intent": "refund", "aftersales_type": "refund_only", "hard": false, "note": "重复付款"}
{"case_id": "HT06", "text": "还没发货，帮我取消并退款。", "intent": "refund", "aftersales_type": "refund_only", "hard": false, "note": "取消订单"}
